# Low Water, Act 3: ruleset additions. Director's file, 2026-10-17. Private.
# Quests, people, items, opponents and encounters for the gale. Plan: design/ACT3-PLAN.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- people
@char varty_master
name: The master of the Ellen Varty
speaker: VARTY
faction: shelf
about: A collier master in a gale, heard by speaking trumpet if at all.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- quests
@quest a3.lamps
name: The Lamps for the Gale
about: The three lamps the town chose, kept alight through the gale.
stage: open: Three lamps chosen at the second dawn. Each needs oil, a wick, and somebody in the wind.
stage: kept: The chosen lamps burned through the gale.
stage: lost: A chosen lamp went out in the gale.
done: kept, lost

@quest a3.shelf
name: Who Types the Shelf
about: The tube, the sticking e, and the back room on the Ropewalk.
stage: door: The door on the Ropewalk.
stage: hester: Hester Gannet types the Shelf.
stage: why: Why she types it.
done: why

@quest a3.eye
name: The Eye
about: Forty minutes of calm, and a boat.
stage: boat: A boat for the eye.
stage: out: On the water in the eye.
done: out

@quest a3.oldlight
name: Inside the Old Light
about: Three rooms the tide floods and drains.
stage: in: Inside the drowned door.
stage: low: The low room.
done: low

@quest a3.wreckers
name: The Real Wreckers
about: Somebody goes up the mole in the gale to put Mother out for a ship.
stage: warned: The collier Ellen Varty is in the bay's mouth by four.
stage: climb: The wreckers are on the mole.
stage: stopped: The wreckers were stopped.
stage: done: Mother went out, and the collier came on.
done: stopped, done

@quest a3.vote
name: The Town's Last Vote
about: What the town will do with the verdict.
stage: called: The town is called to the weigh-house.
stage: voted: The town has voted.
done: voted

@quest a3.bulb
name: The Old Bulb
about: Its fate.
stage: open: The Old Bulb, wherever the procession left it.
stage: decided: The Old Bulb's fate is decided.
done: decided

@quest a3.lens
name: Mother's Lens
about: What Mother burns with through the gale.
stage: open: Green, gapped, broken or crowned.
stage: fitted: Mother's lens for the gale.
done: fitted

@quest a3.surge
name: The Surge
about: The morning high water, with the storm behind it.
stage: coming: Six metres twenty at a quarter to seven, with the surge.
stage: held: The water stopped at the Brine's step.
stage: in: The water came in.
done: held, in

@quest a3.verdict
name: Claim 4471/G, the final apportionment
about: The last cause, written in the Brine at dawn.
stage: open: The final verdict, by twenty past six.
stage: sent: The verdict has gone down the tube.
done: sent

@quest a3.keelq
name: Keel's Question
about: The Board asks something nobody has asked it.
stage: asked: The Board asked its question.
done: asked

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- items
@item i.oilcan
name: A can of lamp oil
stack: yes
about: For a gale lamp. A can is about an hour of a lamp in the wind.

@item i.storm_shutter
name: A storm shutter for a lamp
about: Tin, with a slot. The wind cannot reach the wick through it.

@item i.crown
name: The crown of prisms
about: Fifty-six of Mother's numbered prisms, out of the Gasholder.

@item i.adaptor
name: Fisk's bayonet adaptor
about: Brass. It lets a carbon filament bulb seat in an arc pedestal, once.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- opponents and encounters
@foe f.wrecker
name: A wrecker on the gallery
faction: board
standing: 11
breath: 6
poise: 4
moves: bar, shove_rail, hook_pull
yields: standing <= 3

@foe f.wrecker_lead
name: The wreckers' leader
faction: board
standing: 17
breath: 6
poise: 6
moves: bar, shove_rail, rally
yields: standing <= 5

@encounter e3.oldlight
name: The strippers in the Old Light
area: oldlight
foe: f.stripper_lead 1
foe: f.stripper 2
param: eye-ends (the water rises when the eye passes)
prop: snare 0 0 ? has(oldlight.line_rigged)
talk: fx3.oldlight.claim | Read them the claim ? fight_struck >= 1 & fight_lamb_standing >= 4
win: oldlight.fight.win
yield: oldlight.fight.yield
fled: oldlight.fight.fled
down: oldlight.fight.down

@encounter e3.oldlight.sneak
name: The strippers in the Old Light, from behind
area: oldlight
opening: sneak
foe: f.stripper_lead 1
foe: f.stripper 2
param: eye-ends
prop: snare 0 0 ? has(oldlight.line_rigged)
talk: fx3.oldlight.claim | Read them the claim ? fight_struck >= 1 & fight_lamb_standing >= 4
win: oldlight.fight.win
yield: oldlight.fight.yield
fled: oldlight.fight.fled
down: oldlight.fight.down

@encounter e3.gallery
name: The real wreckers on Mother's gallery
area: lamp
foe: f.wrecker_lead 1
foe: f.wrecker 2
param: gale (gusts over 20 m/s stagger mid-swing, both sides)
param: lens-behind
prop: cut 4 4 ? mother != burning
talk: fx3.gallery.names | Say their names, and the Patience's ? fight_struck >= 1 & has(strippers.named)
win: mole3.fight.gallery.win
yield: mole3.fight.gallery.yield
fled: mole3.fight.gallery.fled
down: mole3.fight.gallery.down

@encounter e3.gallery.sneak
name: The real wreckers, from the lamp room
area: lamp
opening: sneak
foe: f.wrecker_lead 1
foe: f.wrecker 2
param: gale
param: lens-behind
talk: fx3.gallery.names | Say their names, and the Patience's ? fight_struck >= 1 & has(strippers.named)
win: mole3.fight.gallery.win
yield: mole3.fight.gallery.yield
fled: mole3.fight.gallery.fled
down: mole3.fight.gallery.down

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- talk exits
@node fx3.oldlight.claim
place: oldlight_mid
cost: 2
nar: The assessor reads the claim aloud in a drowned room, by lantern, to men with bars: Nature of loss, darkness, malicious.
line: SALLIS: It said wreckers. It never said us.
go: oldlight.fight.yield

@node fx3.gallery.names
place: lamproom
cost: 2
line: LAMB: The Patience. The Ann Tull. I watched you, I named you, and the Board has the names.
nar: A gust takes the gallery and everybody on it holds the rail, and nobody lets go to swing.
go: mole3.fight.gallery.yield
